# Explicit type registrations for the shared component directory.
#
# There is one copy of this directory and it ships exactly as it is: the repo
# root is the plugin, `omarchy plugin add` installs the checkout unchanged, and
# nothing dereferences symlinks or materialises a copy of this directory per
# widget any more (widgets reach it with `import "../../components"`; the
# symlink tree that used to be copied is in git history). Without a qmldir
# the directory is implicit and Quickshell's scanner registers it lazily, so
# the first type looked up in a not-yet-registered directory fails with
# "<T> is not a type" - observed as BatteryData, WorldClockQs, EventSource,
# PrayerTimes and Notify all failing on their first use, one per widget.
# Listing the types makes registration eager and the load order irrelevant.
BatteryData 1.0 BatteryData.qml
ClaudeUsageData 1.0 ClaudeUsageData.qml
CodeburnData 1.0 CodeburnData.qml
DeepSeekData 1.0 DeepSeekData.qml
EventSource 1.0 EventSource.qml
GeoLocation 1.0 GeoLocation.qml
GlassScale 1.0 GlassScale.qml
LiquidGlass 1.0 LiquidGlass.qml
MacOSColors 1.0 MacOSColors.qml
MacSpinner 1.0 MacSpinner.qml
MotionWatch 1.0 MotionWatch.qml
NetworkData 1.0 NetworkData.qml
Notify 1.0 Notify.qml
OmarchyLocation 1.0 OmarchyLocation.qml
OmarrData 1.0 OmarrData.qml
PerfData 1.0 PerfData.qml
PhotoData 1.0 PhotoData.qml
PrayerCard 1.0 PrayerCard.qml
PrayerTimes 1.0 PrayerTimes.qml
StorageData 1.0 StorageData.qml
TailscaleData 1.0 TailscaleData.qml
TzClock 1.0 TzClock.qml
WeatherDataQs 1.0 WeatherDataQs.qml
WorldClockQs 1.0 WorldClockQs.qml
